{"id": "z2032", "pool": "know-mmlu", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The correct answer is A, macram e. Macra me requires the use of at least two needles or cord s to create knot s and patterns. Bra iding typically involves a single needle or tool, crochet uses one hook, and hand-knitting also uses only two needles together.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
